WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.086 --> 00:00:11.190
The kids stand by the sleeping queen.

2
00:00:11.191 --> 00:00:15.587
Jane looks at the wand. "We need this.

3
00:00:15.588 --> 00:00:27.737
And I think it only works . . ."

4
00:00:27.738 --> 00:00:37.477
Pip nods. "When we work together."

5
00:00:37.478 --> 00:00:43.268
Jane holds the wand and Pip grabs on.

6
00:00:43.269 --> 00:00:48.766
"Wake the queen!"

7
00:00:48.767 --> 00:01:05.646
A bright flash fills the room.

8
00:01:05.647 --> 00:01:17.767
The queen yawns and stretches her arms.

9
00:01:17.768 --> 00:01:25.156
"Thank you, sweet children," she says.

10
00:01:25.157 --> 00:01:32.784
June zips over, grinning. "Good work!"

11
00:01:32.785 --> 00:01:38.407
Suddenly the duke runs in. "No!

12
00:01:38.408 --> 00:01:45.588
You woke the queen!"

13
00:01:45.589 --> 00:01:50.434
He stomps his way to the throne.

14
00:01:50.435 --> 00:01:54.400
Jane gasps. "The duke!"

15
00:01:54.401 --> 00:01:58.316
"What do we do?" Pip asks.

16
00:01:58.317 --> 00:02:04.768
The queen smiles. "I'll leave that to you."

17
00:02:04.769 --> 00:02:07.324
June points to the wand.

18
00:02:07.325 --> 00:02:15.992
"You two know what to do now."

19
00:02:15.993 --> 00:02:21.446
The kids hold up the wand.

20
00:02:21.447 --> 00:02:31.358
"It's your turn to stick around!" Zap!

21
00:02:31.359 --> 00:02:39.150
Candy ropes wrap around the duke.

22
00:02:39.151 --> 00:02:45.457
Caramel, cream, and chocolate syrup rain on him.

23
00:02:45.458 --> 00:02:54.820
"Ahh!" the duke cries. "I'm stuck!"

24
00:02:54.821 --> 00:03:05.615
"Good work, sweet children," the queen says.

25
00:03:05.616 --> 00:03:10.219
She steps up to the duke.

26
00:03:10.220 --> 00:03:16.335
"Now I must punish you for your crimes."

